<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1ae9e175 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="1ae9e175" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
<div class="elementor-widget-container">
<p>West End is about 2 miles south of M3 junction 3 on the A322 Bagshot to Guildford Road (and 4 miles north of Worplesdon).&nbsp; At the crossroads just north of the Inn at West End, turn west onto Brentmoor Road an the pub is on the right shortly afterwards.&nbsp; Park along the road or in nearby roads as there is limited parking at the pub.</p></div>
</div>
